### Avoid inheriting test.projects in packages/app/vitest.config.ts

Source: https://github.com/vitest-dev/vitest/blob/main/docs/guide/migration/index.md

Merge a shared configuration without test.projects instead of the root configuration. Referenced configs declaring test.projects now produce nested projects instead of running as a single project.

```ts
import { defineProject, mergeConfig } from 'vitest/config'
import rootConfig from '../../vitest.config' // [!code --]
import sharedConfig from '../../vitest.shared' // [!code ++]

export default mergeConfig(
  // the root config defines `test.projects`, so merging it
  // would turn this project into a container for those projects
  rootConfig, // [!code --]
  sharedConfig, // [!code ++]
  defineProject({
    test: {
      environment: 'jsdom',
    },
  }),
)
```

