### React TypeScript + @vitejs/plugin-react with defineConfig

Source: https://github.com/vitejs/vite/blob/main/packages/create-vite/template-react-ts/vite.config.ts

Standalone React TypeScript app using @vitejs/plugin-react and defineConfig, the recommended way to scaffold a React app with Vite. No explicit build entry needed—Vite uses index.html at the project root as the default entry point.

```typescript
import react from '@vitejs/plugin-react'
import { defineConfig } from 'vite'

// https://vite.dev/config/
export default defineConfig({
  plugins: [react()],
})
```

