### Configuring Data Mode with createBrowserRouter and RouterProvider

Source: https://reactrouter.com/start/modes

Move route configuration outside React rendering to enable data loaders, actions, pending states, and fetchers.

```tsx
import {
  createBrowserRouter,
  RouterProvider,
} from "react-router";

let router = createBrowserRouter([
  {
    path: "/",
    Component: Root,
    loader: loadRootData,
  },
]);

ReactDOM.createRoot(root).render(
  <RouterProvider router={router} />,
);
```

